### mac-miller
Malcolm McCormick died on 7 September 2018 of counterfeit oxycodone pills containing fentanyl. Cameron Pettit sold them to him; Ryan Reavis supplied Pettit at Stephen Walter's direction. Walter received more than 17 years and Reavis 131 months. His mother, Karen Meyers, told the court that her life "went dark" when he died. His last album, *Circles*, was released posthumously in 2020.
