### juice-wrld
- Jarad Higgins died on 8 December 2019, six days after turning 21. Federal and state agents met his private jet at Chicago's Midway airport on a tip that it carried narcotics and guns.
- A friend told police he swallowed several Percocet pills, possibly to hide them from the agents. He had a seizure, and an agent gave him Narcan.
